Comment: 50,0:00:17.00,0:00:17.04,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Cold Open
Comment: 50,0:01:01.04,0:01:01.08,Default,chptr,0,0,0,opsync,OP
Comment: 50,0:02:32.01,0:02:32.05,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Part A
Comment: 50,0:11:58.03,0:11:58.07,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Part B
Comment: 50,0:22:22.99,0:22:23.03,Default,chptr,0,0,0,edsync,ED
Comment: 50,0:23:52.99,0:23:53.04,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Preview
Dialogue: 50,0:00:19.00,0:00:19.96,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Here I go.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:19.96,0:00:20.63,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:26.46,0:00:28.09,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,I win again.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:28.09,0:00:29.80,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,You pulled the joker, didn't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:29.80,0:00:31.80,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You don't know that yet!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:33.39,0:00:34.18,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Ready.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:36.06,0:00:38.85,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Why didn't you take it?!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:38.85,0:00:41.23,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,You're so obvious.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:41.73,0:00:44.65,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We've got a music program\Nand a radio recording coming up.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:44.65,0:00:47.36,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Things are looking bright for Once More!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:47.94,0:00:49.61,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Now, next up...
Dialogue: 50,0:00:51.86,0:00:53.74,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,A new offer!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:54.70,0:00:56.24,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:58.41,0:00:59.91,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.39,0:02:39.01,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.01,0:02:40.47,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.47,0:02:41.47,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:42.06,0:02:46.23,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,Shinshu Music Fes is a gathering\Nof new generation artists.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.65,0:02:50.82,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,We would like for your popular talent\NLuluttoLilly to perform there.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.82,0:02:53.49,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,It's certain to create a lot of buzz.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.49,0:02:55.11,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:55.11,0:02:58.62,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We would like to make a proposal of our own.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.62,0:03:00.54,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,What would it be?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.87,0:03:06.29,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We're actually planning a major\Nsuccession to the LuluttoLilly project.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.67,0:03:08.42,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,A succession?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.42,0:03:10.17,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Huh, you do?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:10.17,0:03:11.13,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Roll with it.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.13,0:03:12.42,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Indeed we do.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.72,0:03:17.55,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,LuluttoLilly, as our double center,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.55,0:03:20.30,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,will be joined by three carefully-selected members,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.30,0:03:23.52,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,perfecting their new image!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.27,0:03:27.19,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,A new image...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.48,0:03:29.31,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, president?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:29.31,0:03:31.02,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,We're perfecting them.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.03,0:03:36.61,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,So I take it that at this event...?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.07,0:03:39.99,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Yes, we would like to unveil them there.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.12,0:03:44.91,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,That sounds great. We would be delighted.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.58,0:03:47.79,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:50.00,0:03:53.96,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,With that said, we'll be forming a new group
Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.96,0:03:57.22,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,and performing at the Shinshu Music Fes!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.55,0:03:59.14,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,A group?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.14,0:04:00.05,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,At the festival?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.05,0:04:02.85,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Yep. We'll all perform together.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.97,0:04:08.64,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,You see, when I watched that LuluttoLilly concert,\Nit made me feel powerful.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.35,0:04:13.90,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,That performance felt like a dream, like magic.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.90,0:04:14.86,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.53,0:04:17.57,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Maybe it's selfish...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.82,0:04:22.12,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,but I want us {\i1}all{\i0} to sing together.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.12,0:04:23.16,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.16,0:04:23.87,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:25.37,0:04:26.75,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.75,0:04:28.33,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:28.87,0:04:31.88,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We've finally gotten the opportunity.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:32.25,0:04:36.05,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Let's work together so we can fly more freely!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.80,0:04:40.09,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We're gonna do our best!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.09,0:04:41.84,Default,All,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:48.31,0:04:49.73,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.73,0:04:51.52,Default,Toko's Mother,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.19,0:04:53.77,Default,Toko's Mother,0,0,0,,You're late yet again.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.27,0:04:55.02,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.94,0:04:59.15,Default,Toko's Mother,0,0,0,,Toko, it's time to stop fooling around.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.15,0:05:02.78,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I'm not fooling around.\NI'm serious about being an idol.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.78,0:05:05.95,Default,Toko's Mother,0,0,0,,You're in your third year of high school now.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.95,0:05:08.79,Default,Toko's Mother,0,0,0,,Don't you have more important\Nmatters to attend to?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.29,0:05:11.08,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I've already had dinner.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:11.08,0:05:11.79,Default,Toko's Mother,0,0,0,,Toko!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.04,0:05:15.17,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I will make this work.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.05,0:05:20.05,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,This is so exciting!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.05,0:05:24.43,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,A group of five idols, going worldwide!\NCould you imagine?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.80,0:05:27.93,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,I don't wanna go too far. I'm staying home.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:27.93,0:05:30.43,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh? Come with me.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.43,0:05:31.27,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Don't wanna.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.81,0:05:34.81,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, there'll be some good food stalls!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.81,0:05:36.61,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Really? Okay, I'll go.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.61,0:05:37.53,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.61,0:05:43.41,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I can't believe I'm performing\Nin a music festival...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:43.87,0:05:45.49,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Are you worried?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:45.49,0:05:46.45,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:47.49,0:05:49.16,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm excited, it's just...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.87,0:05:52.79,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Since we'll all be together,\NI'm sure it'll be fun.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:52.79,0:05:54.33,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.13,0:06:00.05,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.05,0:06:02.26,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I've confirmed our performance.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.26,0:06:06.01,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,I'll reach out to an old acquaintance\Nto make a song for five.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.01,0:06:08.76,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,You do that, prez! Make it the best song ever!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.76,0:06:09.89,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.89,0:06:12.52,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,We should be going soon.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.52,0:06:16.73,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll handle the rest. Good luck with the recording!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:16.73,0:06:18.19,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.19,0:06:19.65,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Let's go, Lulu-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.65,0:06:20.23,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.69,0:06:22.74,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,We're off!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.36,0:06:29.49,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,After this, I'll plan the arrangement,\Nso Sena, you handle the choreo.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.49,0:06:30.24,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.75,0:06:32.33,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,As for you, Asahi...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.00,0:06:35.54,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Lilly-chan and Lulu-chan on stage...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.54,0:06:37.75,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,with Toko-san, Sena-san, and me...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.75,0:06:39.55,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,When all five of us are together...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.55,0:06:40.38,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Asahi?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:40.38,0:06:42.34,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,You there, Asahi?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.34,0:06:43.55,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.55,0:06:44.76,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,I've got it.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:45.43,0:06:47.76,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,I've got it!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.76,0:06:49.10,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Huh? What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.31,0:06:52.35,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,No, um, it's...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.69,0:06:56.48,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,I'm off now!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.61,0:06:59.94,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.65,0:07:07.24,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Why do you suppose Asahi stormed off like that?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.24,0:07:08.70,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Beats me.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.70,0:07:12.37,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I can never tell what's going on in her head.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.70,0:07:15.33,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,You don't, yet you brought her on?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.33,0:07:18.04,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Well, when I saw her pictures,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.04,0:07:22.34,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,it made me think,\N"if we're a group of five, we'll make it!"
Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.13,0:07:24.59,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,So just you being you.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.22,0:07:28.43,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Also, that sponsored stream is tomorrow, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.43,0:07:33.18,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Yeah! Hope you check it out,\NI prepped a big surprise!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.02,0:07:35.48,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.98,0:07:40.69,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Where to transform...?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:42.90,0:07:44.07,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Litto!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.44,0:07:46.61,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Letto!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:54.58,0:07:56.21,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lililula palilula,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:58.21,0:08:00.08,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,pam pam power!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.46,0:08:02.21,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lululila pululila,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:02.21,0:08:04.88,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,pop'n pam!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.71,0:08:43.34,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,We're livestreaming from here?!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.88,0:08:48.76,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,You'll be creating a collab dish\Nusing the sponsor's product Umapon.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.76,0:08:52.80,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Apparently if it comes out good,\Nthey'll sell it at the festival!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.80,0:08:56.93,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,So we're promoting the festival\Nby creating a dish for it!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.93,0:08:57.64,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.64,0:09:00.60,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Today, I'll be the cameraman and director.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.94,0:09:03.31,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Will you two be good to cook?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.31,0:09:05.23,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes, I can handle it a little.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.23,0:09:06.32,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,A-OK!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.32,0:09:07.57,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Alright then!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.99,0:09:10.57,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I can help however you need.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.57,0:09:16.08,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I'm gonna greet the event organizers.\NWe'll talk after.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.08,0:09:18.00,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Glad to be working with you today!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.00,0:09:20.12,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Us as well.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.12,0:09:24.63,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it,\NI don't think I've ever cooked before.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:24.63,0:09:26.71,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Huh?! What will you do?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.38,0:09:29.63,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lilly-san...?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.63,0:09:31.43,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go fix my hair.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.43,0:09:32.18,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:33.47,0:09:36.01,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Uguisu, is anyone there?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.72,0:09:37.60,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:37.60,0:09:39.73,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Okay then.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.73,0:09:41.73,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lililula palilula,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.73,0:09:45.11,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,make sure we create an awesome dish!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.61,0:09:50.15,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Hi there! How is everyone?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.15,0:09:51.86,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.86,0:09:53.70,Default,Fuu/Rui,0,0,0,,We're LuluttoLilly!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:53.70,0:09:55.91,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Welcome to the stream, everyone!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.91,0:10:01.62,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,By the way, this is Toko from Production Once More!\NI'll be the cameraman and director!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:01.62,0:10:03.00,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,So exciting!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.71,0:10:09.88,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,This is a special livestream for SMF!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.88,0:10:15.68,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,We'll be using our sponsor's Umapon\Nto create a yummy new dish!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:15.68,0:10:18.76,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What kind of dish will it be?\NWatch and find out!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.76,0:10:23.81,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,There'll also be a major announcement\Nat the end of the stream, so stay tuned!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.81,0:10:27.06,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Now, let's see what the ingredients are!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.06,0:10:28.69,Default,Fuu/Rui,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.07,0:10:32.11,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,What will they be?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:35.91,0:10:38.20,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Vegetables and fruits!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.20,0:10:39.87,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,And... a crab?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:39.87,0:10:43.62,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Awesome, right? I worked hard to get that!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.50,0:10:47.21,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,The surprise...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:47.50,0:10:49.25,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,was a crab?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.25,0:10:51.71,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Way to blow through your budget.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.71,0:10:54.63,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Let's start cooking!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.63,0:10:55.59,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.09,0:10:59.76,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Hmm... I'll put ponzu on bananas to make...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.76,0:11:01.18,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,ponzu bananas!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.18,0:11:04.23,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Hey! You have to make a real dish!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.23,0:11:06.77,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh? I am!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:06.77,0:11:08.61,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,With a crab and vegetables...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.06,0:11:10.61,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,How about crab hotpot?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.03,0:11:13.69,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.24,0:11:19.33,Default,Tokoo,0,0,0,,You're putting it in whole? That's bold.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:19.33,0:11:21.49,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Doesn't it look cool?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:22.24,0:11:24.29,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,You doing good, Lulu?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.29,0:11:26.75,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes! I just finished cutting the veggies.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.75,0:11:27.50,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.71,0:11:30.00,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.00,0:11:33.30,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Making a special Umapon parfait!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.30,0:11:35.42,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It'll be very tangy and delicious!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.26,0:11:38.76,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Don't you think, Toko-san?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.76,0:11:41.01,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Huh? Um... sure, I guess.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.01,0:11:42.97,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,I'll pass.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.97,0:11:45.02,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,It could be yummy!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.52,0:11:48.65,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lulu-chan, your cutting is very good!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:48.65,0:11:50.69,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Yeah! Are you a good cook?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.69,0:11:54.28,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Thank you. I sometimes cook at home.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:54.28,0:11:55.78,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I wanna try your cooking!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.03,0:12:03.24,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Lilly-chan, you're so cute!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.24,0:12:06.71,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Your humble servant will support you again today!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.71,0:12:12.00,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,"I wish I were the plate holding Lilly-chan's food!"
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.46,0:12:15.38,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,"Lulu-chan, where can I eat your home-cooked food?"
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.38,0:12:19.30,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,"Lilly-chan, your parfait looks {\i1}so{\i0} good,\NI want it so bad!"
Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.30,0:12:20.97,Default,Asahi/Sena,0,0,0,, – "Lilly-cha—"\N– What'cha up to?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.14,0:12:23.60,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Gosh gosh gosh...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.93,0:12:28.19,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Huh? 03bonbon... isn't that one of our regulars?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.19,0:12:33.02,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,So the person leaving all those\Ncrazy comments was you, Asahi.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.02,0:12:35.40,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,N-No, this is...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.28,0:12:40.03,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Please don't tell Lilly-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.53,0:12:43.16,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,How's the food coming along, you two?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.16,0:12:44.74,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It's going great!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:44.74,0:12:47.04,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,The hotpot should be done soon.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.04,0:12:49.67,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lulu-chan, is there anything I can help with?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.67,0:12:52.04,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Can you put the plates out please?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.04,0:12:53.13,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.67,0:12:57.59,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,This is great! The crab hotpot is coming together...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:59.68,0:13:01.64,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Lilly, where's the crab?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.64,0:13:03.18,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh? It should be right...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.23,0:13:17.86,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Wh-What in the world? It's a giant crab!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.86,0:13:21.74,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Something in the hotpot must've\Nmade it grow humongous!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.74,0:13:25.99,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,This peaceful cooking stream has turned into a disaster!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.99,0:13:27.58,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,The crab's scary!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:27.58,0:13:29.71,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,How big!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.71,0:13:32.08,Default,Staff A,0,0,0,,I didn't hear about this!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.96,0:13:40.55,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I messed up again!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:49.10,0:13:51.06,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What the heck?!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.85,0:13:54.31,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Well, I gotta keep working...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.31,0:13:57.44,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,The giant crab is destroying the kitchen\Nin a fit of rage!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.44,0:14:00.07,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,It must be angry at them for cooking it!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.32,0:14:03.82,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Crab! We're streaming right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.82,0:14:06.08,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Please calm down!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.08,0:14:07.24,Default,Staff B,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.24,0:14:08.58,Default,Staff A,0,0,0,,Go back into the pot!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.29,0:14:15.42,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Over here, crab!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:15.42,0:14:16.67,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Let's go outside!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.09,0:14:19.67,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Lilly is guiding the crab toward the exit!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.67,0:14:22.51,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,But will the crab obey?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:28.01,0:14:30.10,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I-It was no use!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.10,0:14:33.14,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Doesn't look like we can persuade it.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:33.14,0:14:36.06,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,The crab started blowing bubbles like crabs do!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.06,0:14:38.44,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,This is bad! It's eat or be eaten!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.44,0:14:40.78,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Please calm down!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.78,0:14:42.95,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Girls, find somewhere to hide!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.95,0:14:44.20,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.34,0:15:01.63,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,This is magic, isn't it?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.80,0:15:06.39,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,But I have to do something.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.39,0:15:10.89,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Been a while since Once More's\Ndone something like this...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.89,0:15:13.14,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Yeah... that's one crazy crab.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.14,0:15:15.35,Default,Mizuka,0,0,0,,What happened to the crab hotpot?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.35,0:15:17.77,Default,Momo,0,0,0,,Dunno, but this is pretty cool.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:18.11,0:15:23.99,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,At this moment, I am hiding\Nfrom the giant crab for my safety.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:23.99,0:15:27.28,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Viewers, rest assured—Lilly and Lulu are safe too.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.78,0:15:28.91,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What even is this...?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.45,0:15:31.20,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Is the stream doing okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.70,0:15:33.20,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Wait, what?!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.95,0:15:35.21,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We're going viral?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.91,0:15:37.46,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I can't just let this be!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.46,0:15:38.54,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.54,0:15:39.33,Default,Staff A,0,0,0,,Y-Yes?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.33,0:15:41.46,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Please keep the stream running!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.46,0:15:42.55,Default,Staff A,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.17,0:15:45.80,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Sorry to trouble you. I know you're in high demand.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.80,0:15:49.34,Default,Composer,0,0,0,,I told ya, it's no trouble.\NJust buy me a drink, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.34,0:15:50.55,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Is cola alright?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.97,0:15:53.31,Default,Composer,0,0,0,,You never change.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:53.31,0:15:54.06,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Thanks, man.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.81,0:15:58.52,Default,Composer,0,0,0,,LuluttoLilly is with Kandachi's agency, yeah?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.52,0:16:01.65,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Yeah. They should be livestreaming right about now.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.65,0:16:02.77,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.86,0:16:05.78,Default,Creature 1,0,0,0,,Lilly-chan, run for it!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:05.78,0:16:08.03,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,Here's your order... huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.74,0:16:10.41,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.41,0:16:12.24,Default,Creature 2,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:12.24,0:16:14.29,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,She's up to some antics again...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.29,0:16:16.79,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Wait for me, you two!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.79,0:16:18.08,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Sena, are you there?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.08,0:16:19.54,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Oh, Toko.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.54,0:16:20.96,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What's going on here...?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.96,0:16:22.88,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Oh, Asahi too! Perfect!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.88,0:16:23.71,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Whuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.71,0:16:26.38,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Take some stuff to fight with!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.38,0:16:27.34,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,To fight?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.34,0:16:28.55,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,What d'ya mean?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:28.55,0:16:30.55,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Let's get a move on!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:40.48,0:16:43.82,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Get back into the pot this instant!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.82,0:16:44.98,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:44.98,0:16:46.11,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.65,0:16:48.99,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:48.99,0:16:50.49,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We're here to rescue you!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.24,0:16:53.49,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,What in the world?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.49,0:16:54.58,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Girls!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:54.58,0:16:56.04,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We made it in time!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.04,0:16:58.37,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,That's one crazy surprise.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.37,0:17:01.21,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,The crab I ordered online turned gigantic!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.21,0:17:02.00,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:02.00,0:17:03.54,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Let's fight it!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:05.75,0:17:06.55,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.38,0:17:09.84,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.30,0:17:11.51,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Toko!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.10,0:17:16.22,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Toko-san! Sena-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.06,0:17:19.73,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,That's enough of this!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.56,0:17:22.56,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lululila pululila,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.56,0:17:24.82,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,help me keep everyone safe!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:34.83,0:17:36.74,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,This'll help get it back in the pot!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.91,0:17:40.33,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Go get it, Lilly!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.33,0:17:41.87,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,You've got this!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.87,0:17:43.63,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.60,0:17:58.81,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh no, it's not going back!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.77,0:18:01.14,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Awful crabby.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:01.14,0:18:02.64,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,But it's working!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.98,0:18:05.52,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,I'm seeing Once More in action...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:06.52,0:18:08.82,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I can't make Lilly-san handle this alone!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.07,0:18:12.49,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Asahi-san, can I borrow that?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.49,0:18:13.91,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,S-S-S-Sure!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:13.91,0:18:15.41,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.62,0:18:25.33,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lilly-san, let's do it together!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.33,0:18:26.08,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.09,0:18:30.05,Default,Fuu/Rui,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.27,0:18:43.73,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.98,0:18:47.90,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Meow did it!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.90,0:18:50.48,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Crab crab, yay!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.48,0:18:51.74,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Did they do it?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.24,0:18:52.99,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.99,0:19:02.08,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:02.08,0:19:04.54,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Our very scrumptious-looking crab hotpot...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.54,0:19:06.50,Default,Fuu/Rui,0,0,0,,is finished!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.13,0:19:08.00,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.67,0:19:13.01,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,It was a heck of a battle,\Nbut we finished the crab hotpot!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.01,0:19:18.22,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,But before we taste it,\NI have a major announcement to make.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.76,0:19:23.77,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Production Once More has formed a new group!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:23.77,0:19:26.85,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,It's called... More: Once More!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:27.90,0:19:31.98,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,All five of us will perform for the first time\Nat the Shinshu Music Fes!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:31.98,0:19:34.53,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Please give us your support!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:39.91,0:19:41.99,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Dang, a new group!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:41.99,0:19:43.87,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,This is gonna rock!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.87,0:19:45.79,Default,Creature 1,0,0,0,,That looks so good!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:45.79,0:19:48.50,Default,Creature 2,0,0,0,,I think I'm in love with them!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.67,0:19:51.29,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,What a handful.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:55.76,0:19:58.09,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,"That's some amazing CGI."
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.09,0:20:01.81,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,"A giant crab!" "Lilly-chan's so cute!"
Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.48,0:20:11.11,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,It really is bizarre that the crab\Nwould grow giant and go on a rampage...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.11,0:20:14.11,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Well, it did bring in a lot of viewers.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.61,0:20:16.65,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,So maybe it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.53,0:20:20.62,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,I told you, it's not like that!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.95,0:20:23.24,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,I wasn't trying to be sketchy!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:23.24,0:20:24.70,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Relax.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.70,0:20:25.45,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:25.79,0:20:26.87,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Here's the thing.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.58,0:20:30.63,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Oh, I see!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.63,0:20:33.59,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything, 03bonbon-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.38,0:20:39.72,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,I just love idols so much, idols are my life!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:40.64,0:20:45.47,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,I've been following Once More\Nsince both of you made your debut!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:46.85,0:20:48.02,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.02,0:20:49.48,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:49.48,0:20:52.61,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Then Lilly-chan became my top oshi\Nand I fell in love with Lulu-chan too!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:52.61,0:20:55.40,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,But I thought it'd get messy if you found out.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.40,0:20:59.91,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,There has to be a clear line kept\Nbetween idols and fans!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.91,0:21:01.99,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, that makes sense.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.99,0:21:05.74,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,But I didn't think I'd end up on stage so fast.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.24,0:21:07.50,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Oh, um!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:08.41,0:21:10.08,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Could you look at this?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:12.17,0:21:13.92,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Are these costumes for all of us?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.92,0:21:17.96,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Yeah! I was doing research on idol costumes
Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.96,0:21:21.64,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,and got a huge flash of inspiration\Nand just started drawing!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:23.18,0:21:27.14,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Wow, these are good!\NThey capture our personalities very well.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.14,0:21:28.10,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Approved!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.10,0:21:28.93,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.93,0:21:30.64,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:30.64,0:21:33.69,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Hey, I saw your stream earlier.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:33.69,0:21:35.69,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,That crab was amazing.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:35.69,0:21:38.15,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Prez! What were you up to?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:38.15,0:21:40.53,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,That's a good question...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:40.53,0:21:41.66,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Dat-dah!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:41.66,0:21:43.91,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Is that...?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:43.91,0:21:46.74,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Yep. A new song for More: Once More.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.74,0:21:47.95,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:50.12,0:21:52.79,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,This is a song for all five of us!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.79,0:21:54.79,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,It's finally happening!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.71,0:21:56.80,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Toko?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.34,0:21:58.30,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:59.13,0:22:02.51,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,When you give up on a dream partway,\Nit eats away at you,
Dialogue: 50,0:22:02.51,0:22:05.85,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,so keep running until you're fulfilled.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:07.68,0:22:11.06,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Have you ever had dreams like that, Uncle?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.06,0:22:12.60,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Nope, can't say I have.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:15.86,0:22:17.15,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,That tracks!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.15,0:22:18.69,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Hey, I could have one.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.69,0:22:20.32,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,There's no way, Uncle.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.32,0:22:21.40,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Huh? I do.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:21.40,0:22:22.20,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Never heard of it!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:22.20,0:22:22.99,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,I do!
